1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,193
ALARM. COMMUTE. 40 HOURS.

2
00:00:02,193 --> 00:00:02,734
PAYDAY...

3
00:00:02,734 --> 00:00:04,439
and a week later, it's GONE.

4
00:00:04,559 --> 00:00:06,500
So is the 9-to-5 a TRAP?

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,223
In 1886,

6
00:00:10,223 --> 00:00:12,473
hundreds of thousands of workers

7
00:00:12,473 --> 00:00:13,907
STRUCK for an 8-HOUR DAY.

8
00:00:14,027 --> 00:00:16,407
By 1940, federal law

9
00:00:16,407 --> 00:00:18,123
made 40 HOURS the standard week.

